> An independent check compared the finalized text with the source, with the instructions for the finalization and with the source of every change. It found every required change made and every replacement marked "verbatim" exact. It raised four minor points and four nits about this note, and it listed citation mismatches in other notes. Every point was found valid. The table records how each was resolved, and the record above lists the resulting changes. The changes made in answer to the check have not been checked again.
> 
